    "round_1": "G: 4 (1, 5, 7, 12) vs H: 8 (2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 9, 10, 11) [Colleague 2 defected to H]",
    "round_2": "G: 4 (1, 5, 7, 12) vs H: 8 (2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 9, 10, 11) [No shifts; positions hardened]"
